## Margin trend

Operating margin dipped to 10.9% in Q1, the seasonal low, then climbed for two straight quarters to 17.6% in Q3.

chart line q y=margin unit=% min=0 target="14.5 trailing 4Q" mark="Q2 2026 new sites" title="Operating margin by quarter"

## Notes

- Q1 is the seasonal low for the group.
- Two new locations opened on 2026-05-18, which explains part of the Q2 and Q3 growth.

! The Q3 2026 figures are unaudited.
